- Ask: “We seek board approval to (a) implement an immediate hiring freeze and discretionary spend pause, (b) authorize the finance team to negotiate a bridge facility up to $X, and (c) present a detailed 90-day cost plan at the next meeting. Requested decision timeline: 7 days.”

