- Short bridge round or convertible note (fast but may dilute).
- Revenue-based financing or venture debt (non-dilutive but adds fixed repayments).
- Strategic partner prepayments, customer deposits, or channel financing.
- Sale or monetization of non-core assets or IP/licensing.

