2. Revenue acceleration: convert renewals to upfront, push enterprise closes, targeted upsell campaigns.
3. Financing if gap remains: small bridge or RBF to buy time while executing growth.
4. Structural cuts only if needed: headcount reductions as a last resort with clear cost/benefit analysis.

