Medium-term (60–120 days)
- Renegotiate or refinance large fixed contracts (office lease, telecom).
- Consolidate tools/platforms; eliminate redundant SaaS.
- Reassess headcount: redeploy vs. targeted reductions; consider voluntary separation packages.
- Implement shifts in comp (bonus deferrals, performance-linked equity) if needed.

Structural / strategic (120+ days)
- Product rationalization: sunset low-margin or low-adoption features.
- Outsource or offshore non-core functions to reduce cost.
- Office footprint optimization, hybrid work policies to reduce facilities cost.
