- Required reduction = 131.25K − 87.5K = $43.75K/month (≈33% reduction).

Priority levers (practical, ordered by speed & impact)
1. Revenue acceleration (highest-value, may be fastest):
   - Push for near-term enterprise deals with upfront payments, prepayments, or annual contracts.
