- 33% cost reduction → burn ≈ 87.5K → runway = 24 months.
- 40% cost reduction → burn ≈ 78.75K → runway ≈ 26.7 months.

Suggested 1-page finance narrative (for leadership / board)
- Executive snapshot (1–2 lines):
